      },
      "natural_statement": "Adversarially audit, verify, or refute OpenAI Manuscript Family 352 (A finite-time singularity of Calabi flow.; papers: A finite-time singularity of Calabi flow on projective space; Lean status: UNFORMALIZED (No Lean proof in openai/math)): either (a) discover and certify an explicit mathematical flaw, sign/orientation error, counterexample to an intermediate lemma, or statement-fidelity/citation gap with a deterministic symbolic/computational certificate (`verify.py` + `exact_certificate.json`), or (b) independently verify, repair, or generalize the manuscript's core mathematical theorem with a standalone machine-checkable certificate certified by the independent Reviewer.",
      "formal_statement": "",
      "external_assumptions": [],
      "retired_assumptions": [],
