      "natural_statement": "For each allowed d and real |q|<=0.26R, the half-line Green-source contraction in ||j||_infinity<=0.3R constructs a unique source and a positive small tail with |p|<0.001, |xi|<0.25R, vanishing first three jet entries, and continuous dependence.",
